Cell["\<\
Let us calculate the Wootters\[CloseCurlyQuote] concurrence at any \
interaction time (i.e, pulse angle).
Rewrite the post-interaction density operator in terms of pulse angle instead \
of interaction time.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998582735828538*^9, 3.998582747071258*^9}, {
  3.998582866350711*^9, 3.998582905987953*^9}, {3.9985829460470057`*^9, 
  3.998582978401497*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9a00551d-490c-4a37-8b8b-\
41e5dde9da6a"],

